---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConsultForm from '../components/ConsultForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="AI Workforce Materiality Briefing | Lozen Advisory" description="A 90-minute paid briefing for boards, CFOs, General Counsel, CHROs, and risk leaders examining AI workforce materiality, verification strain, and governance exposure.">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <a href="/#services">Services</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; AI Workforce Materiality Briefing</div>
    <span class="pill">Paid Strategic Briefing</span>
    <div class="ic-lg"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:52px;height:52px;color:var(--accent-2)"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></div>
    <h1>AI Workforce Materiality Briefing</h1>
    <p class="sub">Stop measuring software adoption. Start governing human-capital exposure.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#consult" class="btn btn-accent">Request the Briefing →</a>
      <a href="#how" class="btn btn-ghost">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="prose reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Overview</span>
      <h2 class="h2">AI adoption can improve output while concentrating hidden workforce risk.</h2>
      <p>When leadership mandates AI use without measuring the judgment required to verify, correct, contextualize, and defend the output, the organization creates an unpriced exposure.</p>
      <p>This private 90-minute briefing helps leadership see where AI velocity is relying on hidden human capacity and where standard metrics are missing the risk.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="checklist" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>AI adoption blind spots</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Power User Trap℠ analysis</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Verification and calibration burden</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Productivity-claim scrutiny</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Human-attribution conditions</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Board-facing advisory leave-behind</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">What's included</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Everything in this service</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></div><h3>Blind-spot review</h3><p>Identify where AI-assisted output is moving faster than review and escalation systems.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg></div><h3>Power User Trap℠</h3><p>Map where verification work is concentrating among high-capability employees.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg></div><h3>Capacity exposure</h3><p>Examine workload, judgment, and institutional knowledge being consumed by AI adoption.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div><h3>Productivity claims</h3><p>Test which reported gains can be substantiated after hidden labor is counted.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div><h3>Name Standard℠</h3><p>Evaluate what must exist before AI-assisted work carries a professional name or approval.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg></div><h3>Board leave-behind</h3><p>Provide a concise structure for continued internal inquiry and governance discussion.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2 class="h2">A clear advisory process</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Scope</h3><p>Define the AI implementation, workforce, or productivity question leadership needs examined.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">2</div><h3>Examine</h3><p>Review adoption, verification strain, accountability, and disclosure-control exposure.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Map</h3><p>Identify who carries the hidden calibration and exception-handling burden.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">4</div><h3>Brief</h3><p>Deliver the findings and a board-facing advisory leave-behind.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Common questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Is this a discovery call?</h4><p>No. It is a standalone, paid 90-minute strategic briefing.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Who should request it?</h4><p>Boards, CFOs, General Counsel, CHROs, risk leaders, and senior executives accountable for AI implementation.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>What does leadership leave with?</h4><p>A clearer view of workforce, financial, legal, operational, and governance exposure, plus a board-facing structure for next steps.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<ConsultForm serviceHighlight="ai workforce materiality briefing" selectedService="AI Workforce Materiality Briefing" />
</BaseLayout>
